  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 4 - C13\tThe office floorspace contained within the development hereby approved shall be used only as offices ancillary to the main use of the premises as storage of motor vehicles and shall not be used for any other purpose.",
    "Condition : 5 - The storage of motor vehicles shall not take place anywhere on the site except within the building.",
    "Condition : 6 - The parking, loading and turning spaces shown on drawing No. 560007, received 10th May 2008, shall be retained for the use of  the development and such spaces shall not be used for any other purposes.",
    "Condition : 7 - No additional floorspace shall be formed within the unit V7 hereby permitted by means of internal horizontal division without prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 8 - The premises shall only be used for the storage of motor vehicles, not as a  car showroom and there shall be no retail sales or display from the premises."
